1
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:06,350
Your open trade is drawn on the chart as a line at its opening price.

2
00:00:06,450 --> 00:00:10,480
Click its label to edit it.

3
00:00:10,580 --> 00:00:17,950
Drag SL down to set a stop loss. The label shows what you would lose there.

4
00:00:18,050 --> 00:00:25,390
Drag TP up to set a take profit, and see what you would gain.

5
00:00:25,490 --> 00:00:32,200
Click the tick to save both.

6
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:36,560
The trade now shows its Stop and Limit prices.

7
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:40,060
To change them later, click the trade on the chart and drag the lines again.

